              "text": "<p>Slimfair is a local brand in the Philippines established in the year 2014. Engaged in providing innovative and premium quality beauty and wellness products, we are the first brand to introduce organic slimming powder mix drink with whitening, anti-aging and health benefits in the year 2016.</p><p>Our product line includes skincare and dietary supplement which are chemical-free, effectual, made withorganic active ingredients. This is to ensure to give consumers the satisfaction, true to its purpose, only the best experience, and cater to the demand of the people inclined to health and well-being.</p>",
